#X text 20 20 Evolve: every 60 ms \, each layer's targets (model.EVOLVE \, for its engine) move on two slow sines of their own - periods unrelated (x1 \, x1.37 \, x1.71 ... and x1.618 of those) \, so they phase against each other and the sound rarely repeats \, yet the same settings always move the same way. Time runs free (since the patch loaded) or locked to the clock (from Start). The base period: Pace 0 = 5 minutes .. 1 = 25 s. Depth: the layer's Evolve x the master Evolve (PERFRM page) x each target's weight. Each layer's depth and period also go to its voices (al-evd<n> 'depth period': the pads' breathing and orbit \, the drone's and sub's breathing).;
